{"id":"5037","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5037_main_cirrus-spissatus-mamma_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这是一个非常厚实、密集和大块的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状</span><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>的一个突出例子。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷云状顶部</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">冰晶条纹</span>、阴影（这是厚厚的密云的常见特征）以及附近的高空探测指示云在7000米处，这些特征确认了卷云的观测。</p>\n<p>后缘可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">冰晶尾迹</span>。卷云似乎是积雨云上部的残余部分；但是，该地区没有积雨云活动。还存在许多<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">小片的薄高积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Akihito Umehara","location":"日本青森机场","latitude":"纬度: 40° 44' 17'' N","longitude":"经度: 140° 41' 19'' E","date":"28 September 2012 0604 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.12","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.12"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5037_syn_cirrus-spissatus-mamma_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"></div>","copyright":"© 日本气象厅","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5037_upper_cirrus-spissatus-mamma_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>探测是拍摄照片后不到2小时开展的。424 hPa有一个确定的湿度特征，露点降低为2.1°C。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5037_sat_cirrus-spissatus-mamma_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"></div>","copyright":"© 日本气象厅","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4812_main_cirrus-spissatus-mamma_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密</span>卷云的一个例子 - 云下的悬挂突起是不经常看到的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状</span>附加特征。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Alfons Puertas","location":"西班牙巴塞罗那Vallvidrera","latitude":"纬度: 41° 25' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 7' 27'' E","date":"06 June 2016 0000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.12 1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.12 1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5821_main_cirrus-spissatus-with-mamma_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>卷云是分裂云，呈白色、纤细丝条状，或白色或大部分白色的云块或窄条带状。它们呈纤维状（发丝状）或有丝般光泽或二者兼具。在这张震撼的图片中，卷云为厚云块，表面光滑，在逆光看时，云层<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓密而发灰</span>，可将其确定为密云种；云块还会遮挡太阳、遮蔽其轮廓乃至将其遮掩。重要的是有两个小而明显的区域 - 在云的下表面有悬垂的乳状隆起，见<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>。这些是悬球状附加特征。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Hee Sang Yoo","location":"韩国，全罗北道，茂朱郡，雪川面，九千洞路","latitude":"纬度: 35° 54' 28'' N","longitude":"经度: 127° 46' 1'' E","date":"09 September 2014 0000 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.12 2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.12 2"}]}]}